  "goodToKnow": "Der Sportverein is a sports club. In Germany, most sport is organised not by schools but by about 87,000 non-profit clubs with over 27 million memberships, run largely by volunteers. Names like TSV (Turn- und Sportverein), SV, FC or SC are typical, often with a founding year: TSV 1860 München. The Deutscher Olympischer Sportbund (DOSB) is the umbrella organisation. Plural: die Sportvereine."
